# Agent session state: private CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR per agent.
# Contains full conversation transcripts (~20 MB) and the mount point for the
# credentials file (bind-mounted read-only at runtime, always 0 bytes on disk).
**/.claudecfg/

# Caches and environments created inside playgrounds
**/.pipcache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.mplcache/
**/.loprofile/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LaTeX build artefacts
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.out

# Run-local scratch
playground/*.log
playground/*.pid
.last_run.pid
**/.session_id

# Papers an agent downloaded to read. Third-party copyrighted material (ACM, USENIX,
# IEEE, author sites). Each agent's downloads.md records the URL it fetched and how it
# verified the file was the genuine paper, so a run reproduces without shipping them.
# Validators fetch their own copies to check against, into directories of their own
# naming, so match on the filename rather than on one directory name.
**/papers/**
**/mypapers/**
**/*papers*/*.pdf
